      headingLevel: 4,
      content: `**§ 1.14.4.7**

Must be completed a minimum of 48 months. The length of time is measured from the settlement date to the Note
date. In the case of a foreclosure which was included in a bankruptcy, the seasoning timeline will start from the
earlier of the date of discharge of bankruptcy and the foreclosure completion date.`,
